---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
export function getStaticPaths(){return ['en','es','pt','ru','tr'].map(lang=>({params:{lang}}))}
---
<Layout title="Start a Sourcing Project | Sourcing Ally" description="Prepare a clearer China sourcing project brief for email or WhatsApp." lang="en">
  <section class="brief-hero"><div class="container brief-hero-grid"><div><a class="back-link" href="/en/">← Sourcing Ally</a><p class="eyebrow">Project Brief Builder</p><h1>Turn an idea into a clearer sourcing conversation.</h1><p class="hero-intro">Answer the questions you already know. This tool creates a draft message for email or WhatsApp. It does not store the information you enter.</p></div><div class="brief-panel"><span>SA / BRIEF</span><b>PROJECT<br/>BEFORE<br/>PRICE</b><p>A more precise first message usually produces a more useful first response.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="brief-workspace section-pad"><div class="container workspace-grid"><form id="project-brief" class="brief-form"><div class="form-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Step 1 of 3</p><h2>Tell us the essential project facts.</h2><p>You can leave an answer blank if you do not know it yet. Specific details will make the conversation easier.</p></div><div class="form-block"><label>What product do you want to source?<textarea name="product" placeholder="Example: private-label kitchen storage containers, a clothing collection, a consumer electronic accessory…"></textarea></label><label>What quantity are you considering?<input name="quantity" placeholder="Example: 500 units, first sample only, monthly reorder…" /></label></div><div class="form-block"><label>Where will the products be sold or delivered?<input name="destination" placeholder="Example: United States, Spain, Amazon FBA, UAE…" /></label><label>What is your target timing?<input name="timing" placeholder="Example: samples in October, shipment before January…" /></label></div><div class="form-heading second"><p class="eyebrow">Step 2 of 3</p><h2>Describe the important requirements.</h2></div><div class="form-block"><label>Materials, dimensions, colors, or technical requirements<textarea name="requirements" placeholder="Add the specifications that matter. Mention reference drawings, samples, or images if you have them."></textarea></label><label>Packaging, logo, or private-label needs<textarea name="packaging" placeholder="Example: custom box, barcode, logo placement, insert card…"></textarea></label></div><div class="form-heading second"><p class="eyebrow">Step 3 of 3</p><h2>What decision do you need help making?</h2></div><div class="form-block"><label>Choose the main type of support<select name="support"><option value="Supplier sourcing and comparison">Supplier sourcing and comparison</option><option value="Sample review or factory checks">Sample review or factory checks</option><option value="Quality control or final checks">Quality control or final checks</option><option value="Packaging or supplier communication">Packaging or supplier communication</option><option value="Factory visit or independent travel support">Factory visit or independent travel support</option><option value="Not sure yet">Not sure yet</option></select></label><label>Your main question or concern<textarea name="question" placeholder="Example: I need to know whether this supplier can make the product, whether the sample matches our requirements, or how to plan a factory visit."></textarea></label></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="button" type="button" id="email-brief">Create email draft ↗</button><button class="button button-outline" type="button" id="whatsapp-brief">Create WhatsApp draft ↗</button><p>No form data is stored by this website. Opening email or WhatsApp uses those third-party communication services.</p></div></form><aside class="brief-aside"><div class="aside-card dark"><p class="eyebrow">Why this matters</p><h3>Good sourcing begins with a clear written brief.</h3><p>Price is only one answer. A useful first message also explains what must be made, checked, agreed, or decided.</p></div><div class="aside-card"><p class="eyebrow">Include when possible</p><ul><li>Reference images or product links</li><li>Target quantity or a range</li><li>Destination market</li><li>Materials, measurements, or function</li><li>Packaging and branding needs</li><li>Timing and decision needed</li></ul></div><div class="aside-card note"><p class="eyebrow">Fee context</p><p>When a client orders through Sourcing Ally, the minimum sourcing service fee is 5%. Independent factory-travel support is $150 per day when the client does not order through Sourcing Ally.</p><a href="/en/questions/how-do-sourcing-agent-fees-work/">Read the fee question ↗</a></div></aside></div></section>
</Layout>
<script>
  const form = document.querySelector('#project-brief');
  const buildMessage = () => {
    const data = new FormData(form);
    const value = (key) => (data.get(key) || '').toString().trim() || 'Not confirmed yet';
    return `Hello Sourcing Ally,\n\nI would like to discuss a China sourcing project.\n\nProduct: ${value('product')}\nQuantity: ${value('quantity')}\nDestination / sales market: ${value('destination')}\nTarget timing: ${value('timing')}\n\nProduct requirements: ${value('requirements')}\nPackaging / private-label needs: ${value('packaging')}\n\nMain support needed: ${value('support')}\nMain question: ${value('question')}\n\nPlease let me know what information you need next. Thank you.`;
  };
  document.querySelector('#email-brief').addEventListener('click', () => {
    const subject = encodeURIComponent('Sourcing Ally project brief');
    window.location.href = `mailto:sourcingally@gmail.com?subject=${subject}&body=${encodeURIComponent(buildMessage())}`;
  });
  document.querySelector('#whatsapp-brief').addEventListener('click', () => {
    window.open(`https://wa.me/8619002009100?text=${encodeURIComponent(buildMessage())}`, '_blank', 'noopener');
  });
</script>
<style>.brief-hero{background:#f4f8ff;padding:82px 0 94px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.brief-hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(40,103,217,.09) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(40,103,217,.09) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:45px 45px;opacity:.42}.brief-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .48fr;gap:85px;align-items:end;position:relative}.back-link{display:inline-block;color:var(--blue);font-size:.84rem;font-weight:750;margin-bottom:42px}.brief-hero h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,5.9rem);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.075em;max-width:850px;margin:0 0 23px}.brief-hero .hero-intro{font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.75;max-width:680px;color:var(--muted)}.brief-panel{background:var(--gold);min-height:270px;padding:25px;box-shadow:16px 16px 0 rgba(40,103,217,.14);position:relative;overflow:hidden}.brief-panel:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:310px;height:170px;border:1px solid rgba(13,43,80,.35);border-radius:50%;right:-75px;bottom:-70px;transform:rotate(-25deg)}.brief-panel>*{position:relative;z-index:2}.brief-panel span{display:block;font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--coral);font-weight:800}.brief-panel b{display:block;font-size:2.5rem;line-height:.85;letter-spacing:-.08em;margin:30px 0 15px}.brief-panel p{max-width:250px;font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.55;margin:0}.brief-workspace{background:white}.workspace-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .55fr;gap:55px;align-items:start}.brief-form{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:34px;border-radius:20px}.form-heading h2{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.5rem);letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:0 0 10px}.form-heading>p:not(.eyebrow){color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;margin:0;max-width:620px}.form-heading.second{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:30px;margin-top:32px}.form-block{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:22px}.form-block label:first-child:last-child{grid-column:1/-1}.form-block label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--ink)}.form-block input,.form-block textarea,.form-block select{font:inherit;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:13px;outline:none;background:#fbfcfe;resize:vertical}.form-block input:focus,.form-block textarea:focus,.form-block select:focus{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(40,103,217,.1)}.form-block textarea{min-height:115px;line-height:1.55}.form-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:35px}.button-outline{background:white;color:var(--blue);border:1px solid var(--blue)}.button-outline:hover{background:#eef4fb}.form-actions p{width:100%;margin:5px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.55}.brief-aside{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:15px}.aside-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:21px;background:#fff}.aside-card.dark{background:var(--ink);color:white;border-color:var(--ink)}.aside-card h3{font-size:1.35rem;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:0 0 13px}.aside-card p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.aside-card.dark p:not(.eyebrow){color:#cbd8e8}.aside-card ul{margin:0;padding-left:19px;color:#405069;font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.8}.aside-card.note{background:#fff8db;border-left:4px solid var(--gold)}.aside-card.note a{display:inline-block;color:var(--blue);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;margin-top:14px}@media(max-width:850px){.brief-hero-grid,.workspace-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:38px}.brief-panel{max-width:340px}.brief-aside{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}@media(max-width:650px){.brief-hero{padding:65px 0 70px}.brief-hero h1{font-size:3rem}.brief-form{padding:21px}.form-block{grid-template-columns:1fr}.brief-aside{grid-template-columns:1fr}.form-actions{align-items:stretch}.form-actions .button{width:100%;text-align:center}}</style>
